<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK FINMIN SETS BOND/T-BILL AUCTIONS FOR Q2.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK FINMIN SETS BOND/T-BILL AUCTIONS FOR Q2.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak Finance Ministry</p>
<p>on Thursday announced the schedule for planned issues of its</p>
<p>treasury bills (T-bill) and state bonds for the second quarter</p>
<p>of 1997.</p>
<p> Issue	  Date of auction  Maturity	Maturity Date</p>
<p> T-bill	  April 9	   13 weeks	July 10</p>
<p> T-bill	  April 16	  26 weeks	October 16</p>
<p> State bond    April 22	  One year	April 24, 1998</p>
<p> T-bill	  April 30	  Four weeks    May 29</p>
<p> T-bill	  May 7	     Four weeks    June 5</p>
<p> T-bill	  May 14	    13 weeks	August 14</p>
<p> T-bill	  May 21	    26 weeks	November 20</p>
<p> State bond    May 27	    One year	May 29, 1998</p>
<p> T-bill	  June 4	    Four weeks    July 3</p>
<p> T-bill	  June 11	   26 weeks	December 11</p>
<p> State bond    June 17	   One year	June 19, 1998</p>
<p> T-bill	  June 25	   25 weeks	December 18</p>
<p>Note. The ministry does not annouce the amount of bills on</p>
<p>offer at its auctions, nor does it announce a limit price on</p>
<p>bids. All auctions will be held by the National Bank of</p>
<p>Slovakia (NBS).</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
